#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""bsptab - i3-style tabbed window management for bspwm.

Uses ctypes to call X11, Cairo, and Pango directly.
Zero external Python dependencies - only standard library + system C libs.

Architecture:
  - Daemon process manages tab groups via X11 event loop
  - CLI sends commands to daemon via Unix socket
  - Container X windows are reparented to hold multiple client windows
  - Tab bar rendered with Cairo + Pango
"""

